      "Introduction": {
        "content": {
          "content_id": "content_11",
          "html": "<p>Omar wants to be the best long jumper in his sports club. He jumped 321 cm on his first try, but the club\u2019s leaderboard measurements are all in different units, so Omar can\u2019t compare his measurement with the others. Let\u2019s follow Omar as he learns about unit conversion.</p><p>Learning about measurements will require concentration, so find a quiet place to go through this story. If you make a mistake or get stuck, focus on understanding rather than just getting the correct answer as fast as possible. Try to learn from any mistakes!</p><p>Once you\u2019re ready, click Continue to get started!</p>"
        },
        "interaction": {
          "id": "Continue",
          "customization_args": {
            "buttonText": {
              "value": {
                "content_id": "ca_buttonText_13",
                "unicode_str": "Continue"
              }
            }
          },
          "answer_groups": [],
