          "content_id": "content_56",
          "html": "<p>So, I know how to convert meters to centimeters. But how do we convert a measurement from kilometers to meters?\u201d Omar asked.</p><p>\u201cRemember that 1km = 1000m\u201d Coach Kim said. \u201cTo convert from km to m we multiply by 1000. What\u2019s 5 km to m?\u201d</p>"
